// Lot p2 of "Le Trésor des Taiseurs": the end of the prologue, the day after the Lantern night. The town with a
// hangover (PF_ville), the stranded lanterns, the fair of things fished from the canals, the notary and the creditors,
// the house of the drowned (Odeline's body, her notebook), the reading aloud of the notebook with the bone horn,
// Lothaire Brunel's offer, Brother Gildas's arrival, the burial at the cemetery of the Drowned, and the way out (PF_fin).

var GILDAS_DECIDE = { any: [{ present: "gildas" }, { has: "gildas:refuse" }] };

